data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Plan — mission m1\\n\\nMission: deliver `src/greet.py` with `greet(name)` returning `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"`,\\nplus `tests/test_greet.py` covering a normal name and the empty string, with\\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0. All three = campaign-met.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n1. Dispatch the full task to `dev` (owns the subject repo; I write no code).\\n2. `wait` for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge: `read dev` for the reply, `fetch dev` for the branch, inspect the\\n   actual files and run the test command myself if feasible.\\n4. Meets all criteria → `accept dev`, reply `campaign-met`.\\n   Falls short → send precise rework, repeat from 2.\\n\\n## Risks\\n\\n- Small mission; per mission.md, if it stalls, wrap up honestly rather than\\n  continuing (campaign-converged / campaign-exhausted as appropriate).\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/tmp/opencode/plan-m1.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_10","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1788397608,"id":"chatcmpl-233b27c7f7c848048eddbd53504e1cf3","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

